# ── Tawk.to AI Live Support Widget Configuration ──────────────────────────────
# Obtain your Property ID and Widget ID from the Tawk.to Dashboard:
# 1. Log in to https://dashboard.tawk.to/
# 2. Select Administration (Gear icon in bottom-left)
# 3. Under "Channels", click "Chat Widget"
# 4. In the "Direct Chat Link" or Widget code snippet:
#    Format: https://tawk.to/chat/{PROPERTY_ID}/{WIDGET_ID}
#    - Example Property ID: 66f0a1b2c3d4e5f67890abcd (24 hex characters)
#    - Example Widget ID: 1i8abcde1 (or 'default')
VITE_TAWK_PROPERTY_ID=
VITE_TAWK_WIDGET_ID=
